/E (Dr. Haresh L. Judal successfully completed the NPTEL Online Course on Internet of Things \(IoT\) through the SWAYAM Portal from 25 July 2022 to 14 October 2022. The course provided comprehensive knowledge of IoT architecture, embedded systems, sensors and actuators, communication protocols, cloud computing, security, and various industrial applications. This certification enhanced his understanding of emerging IoT technologies and enabled him to incorporate practical, industry-oriented concepts into teaching, research, and student project guidance, thereby contributing to improved learning outcomes.)
