<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 259 0 R
/E (World Paper Bag Day is celebrated every year on 12th July. The main motive behind this day is to spread a positive message of using paper bags and reducing the use of plastic bags. This year?s theme was If you are fantastic, do something dramatic to cut plastic, use paper bags. In order to spread awareness NSS GEC Patan celebrated World Paper Bag Day on 12th July in our college. An online competition was organized by NSS in which participants were asked to make paper bags and submit it offline. In which many NSS volunteers and college students participated. Many participants were also from other states. The best paper bags were chosen out of all responses by Prof. Roshni Chaudary \(E.C. Department\), Prof. Payal Prajapati \(CSE Department\), and Prof. Priyanka Patel \(Mechanical department\). )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
