/E (The NSS Unit of Government Engineering College, Patan celebrated World Paper Bag Day on 12th July to promote environmental sustainability and encourage the use of eco-friendly alternatives to plastic bags. An online paper bag making competition was organized, attracting enthusiastic participation from NSS volunteers and students. The best entries were selected by a panel of faculty judges, and the winners were awarded Bird's Nests to spread the message of bird conservation. E-certificates were presented to all participants, while NSS volunteers distributed handmade paper bags among the faculty members to raise awareness about reducing plastic usage.)
