/P 260 0 R
/E (On 13th July 2022, NSS Volunteers celebrated Guru Purnima by doing Tilak to every professor. Volunteers also invited them for the celebration of this event. The celebration of Guru Purnima was held in electrical seminar hall, GEC Patan. The seminar hall was beautifully decorated by NSS volunteers. At the beginning of the event, Saraswati Vandana and deep Prajvalan took place. After that, the classical dance on the importance of the guru was performed by Dhruvanshi. After completion of the dance, everyone stood up at their place and NSS song was sung by our Volunteers.)
