640 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 261 0 R
/E (Raksha Bandhan is special hindu festival which is celebrated in India and countries like Nepal to symbolize the love between brother and sister. The occasion of Raksha Bandhan is celebrated on the full moon day of the hindu calendar in the month of shravana \(July/August\). On this day, sisters tie rakhi on the wrists of their brother to protect them against evil influences ,and pray for their long life and happiness and in return as a gift brothers gives promises that they will protect her from any harm and keep her always happy. This does not means that the brother protects the sisters . Our soldiers also protect us at the border. They stay away from their home to protect us . So for this, NSS GEC Patan with collaboration of Yuva Foundation organized an event on the occasion of In this way, the students came to knew that their innovative ideas can get the nice place to be presented, and they get encouragement to do Startup and give their contribution to increase the economic of the India.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [9]
>>
