662 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Voting is the expression of our commitment to ourselves,one another,our country and this world.The law does not require citizens to vote, but voting is a very important part of any democracy. By voting, citizens are participating in the democratic process. Citizens vote for leaders to represent them and their ideas, and the leaders support the citizens' interests.everyone in the country irrespective of the caste, colour, gender, creed and income earned is allowed to vote for his own representative. On 28th July 2022, NSS Volunteers celebrated World Nature Conservation Day.On this day Volunteers do a Voting awareness program under the Electoral Literacy Club. The event was organized under the guidence of Dharmesh sir. The celebration of this event was held in civil seminar hall, GEC Patan. The seminar hall was beautifully decorated by NSS volunteers. At the beginning of the event, Saraswati Vandana and deep Prajvalan took place. After that, everyone stood up at their place and NSS song was sung by our Volunteers. Then speech on voting awareness was given by Anika Rehan. Also, volunteers performed drama on importance of voting.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
