682 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 263 0 R
/T (On the occasion of 153rd birth anniversary of Late Shri Mohandas Karamchand Gandhi popularly known as Mahatma Gandhi The Father of Our Nation NSS Unit of GEC Patan organized an online event for celebrating the same. The Event was started by prayer song by NSS Volunteer Smruti Lakdawala. Then NSS song was played. An online drawing competition was organized whose responses were asked to submit through Google Forms. Participants were given 48 hours to submit their responses, as a result of which many numbers of participants had submitted their responses. Out of which 3 Winners were selected by our judges of the event Dr. A.K.Chaudary Sir and Prof. Payal Prajapati Mam. The winners of Drawing Competition were as mentioned below.Speech Competition was held in which Participants were asked to give speech on topic Role of Mahatma Gandhi in Independence of India. The Winners of Speech Competition were appreciated with book and all enthusiastic participants get E-certificate. And Dr. H.S.Bhutadiya sir gave a great speech on personality of Gandhiji. At the end of Event Program Officer of NSS GEC Patan Proff. N.K.Dabhi thanked the guests for their valuable presence and also thanked audience for being present.)
/E (On the occasion of 153rd birth anniversary of Late Shri Mohandas Karamchand Gandhi popularly known as Mahatma Gandhi The Father of Our Nation NSS Unit of GEC Patan organized an online event for celebrating the same. The Event was started by prayer song by NSS Volunteer Smruti Lakdawala. Then NSS song was played. An online drawing competition was organized whose responses were asked to submit through Google Forms. Participants were given 48 hours to submit their responses, as a result of which many numbers of participants had submitted their responses. Out of which 3 Winners were selected by our judges of the event Dr. A.K.Chaudary Sir and Prof. Payal Prajapati Mam. The winners of Drawing Competition were as mentioned below.Speech Competition was held in which Participants were asked to give speech on topic Role of Mahatma Gandhi in Independence of India. The Winners of Speech Competition were appreciated with book and all enthusiastic participants get E-certificate. And Dr. H.S.Bhutadiya sir gave a great speech on personality of Gandhiji. At the end of Event Program Officer of NSS GEC Patan Proff. N.K.Dabhi thanked the guests for their valuable presence and also thanked audience for being present.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
