<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 265 0 R
/E (The joy of giving is organized by NSS volunteers. In Patan city on Thursday, 20th October 2022 to give poor people clothes and sweets. The time of doing this work is 20th Oct 3:00 pm to 7:00 pm. This event is organized to give poor people clothes and sweets the way NSS volunteers collected all wearable clothes from the neighborhood and divide them into the category after that NSS volunteers organized some sweets. After organizing all things NSS volunteer leave for distribution works in the south side of Patan city. First of all, we went to a place which was close to our homes and there we gave the children clothes to wear and gave them some sweets. After that, we went to the nursery and gave sweets to the all workers. Then we went to where the poor people lived and gave clothes and sweets and after that, all the children gathered there and gave sweets and chocolates after that we came back.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
