/P 267 0 R
/E (Har Ghar Dhyan is an event that falls within Azadi ka Amrit Mahotsav. Har ghar dhyan is an event to motivate everyone towards meditation. Meditation can give you a sense of calm, peace and balance that can benefit both your emotional well-being and your overall health. You can also use it to relax and cope with stress by refocusing your attention on something calming. Meditation can help you learn to stay centered and keep inner peace. So for this NSS Unit of GEC Patan organized an event Har Ghar Dhyan= on 29th December, 2022. NSS volunteer Anjali Thakkar hosted this event. She gave some information on meditation and conducted meditation for 15 minutes. Many students and Faculties attended this event and everyone participated in meditation. Everyone felt freshand a lot of peace after this meditation. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
