/Title (Indian Constitution Day is celebrated on 26 November. The celebration of Indian Constitution Day has been started in the year 2015. From 26 November 2015, we are celebrating this day. On the occasion of Indian Constitution Day, the event had been organized by the volunteer of the NSS unit. At the beginning of the event, the Deep Pragatya ceremony has been held in the presence of many professors and respected principal sir. Then after welcoming all the respected members had done.  The speech was given by NSS Volunteer Vikhnesh Pillai. After that expert lecture had been taken by Prof. Sohan G Prajapati about the importance of Indian Constitution Day which gave an overview of it. The event ended with the pledge and National Anthem.)
